==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Moai Statue (Enemy Base)|Moai Statue]].
*10 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Croco]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**30 [[Croco]]s (100%) spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Lure the enemies away from their base so the Moai Statue can't hit them. Even if it does manage to land a hit, it's damage is abysmal so it shouldn't affect the battle.

